    ],
    "correct": 3,
    "solution": "<style>*{overflow-wrap: break-word;} img {max-width:100% !important} </style><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Palanquin Dark'\">- कलकत्ता सर्वोच्च न्यायालय 1774 में स्थापित हुआ और सर एलिजा इम्पे इसके प्रथम मुख्य न्यायाधीश थे।</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span>- The Supreme Court at Calcutta was established in 1774 and Sir Elijah Impey was its first Chief Justice.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\">&nbsp;</p>",
